<title>USA: Capitol Transamerica Corp sets regular div.</title>
<headline>Capitol Transamerica Corp sets regular div.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, Wis. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		     Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.07		     $0.10</p>
<p> Pay		  March 28</p>
<p> Record	     March 14</p>
<p>NOTE: The $0.07/shr rate remains for 1997 remains unchanged. The company paid an extra cash dividend in the prior quarter of $0.10/shr, which was before a three-for-two stock split distributed January 15.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
